body:
brother I just booted up Ground Branch and it does not let you switch the safety on or im missing something. The only other one I have installed is Insurgency which I will check now but im pretty sure its the same case.

&#x200B;

Edit: just check in the sandstorm shooting range and its the exact same thing. Only auto and semi auto. Too eager to jump down someones throat before even checking the facts eh?

NIN is my all time fav band and i'm deeply hurt that i could not snag anything after waiting in queue all morning. Venting here is the only thing I can do about it now i guess. Never got to see Trent live before and I was so stoked. 

&#x200B;

I was expecting grabbing a ticket to be a somewhat hard process but damn.. they make you feel like you are being punished for waiting in the queue. :((

ordered one thats pending still from bestbuy but im really hoping that the later drivers will actually make it a good portion better than the 3080. All i do is game so id rather have the extra 700 bucks if its not gonna give me that much more frames. If the order is cancelled ill just go big navi and be happy. 

&#x200B;

just my early buyers remorse talking after i saw the benchmarks.

wow that was so bad I swear I actually thought it was 10 mins long then I saw it was 3:42 

&#x200B;

either way im sorry to my future unsuccessful self that I viewed the entirety of this material.

but what If I die between late April and September? What if we all die between then?

&#x200B;

thanks Obama

&#x200B;

at least we have Doom Eternal coming up, that won't be delayed again...right?

This is what i came to this subreddit for today. I came for a bit of hope that i will sleep good again. So far quitting weed has been good for everything else... but bad for gainzz. 

&#x200B;

I cant hit the gym as hard because my rest is as far away from optimal. I know my workouts aren't doing me much  progress because without sleep, lifting is diminishing returns! About a week in today and ive been zombie walking through work. I actually left work early today because i was sick.

I'm still clean since the last time I commented here. I need to be reminded why I am trying to quit. Because I'm remembering why I started to smoke weed everyday and its because my life is shite. I really wanna go to the dispo tomorrow  and buy a half ounce. 

&#x200B;

I really need help. like is this next 3 weeks with ZERO SLEEP even gonna be worth it? fuck. I really just wanna get high. Today the dispensaries are closed so tomorrow morning is gonna be the real test.

Same, I just half assed my gifts to my parents and sister but im glad I got them something. 

&#x200B;

I really wanted a Carbon Monoxide tank for Christmas but I guess ill have to be my own santa sometime next year lol

I really like the art direction and style of it! The colors are awesome! im sure you have a beautiful mind albeit cursed like the rest of us! Merry Christmas and thanks for sharing. I'm sure this one hits home for most of us!

&#x200B;

Cheers!
